From: OTB V5 Build <root@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: mediatek: add hardened MT7988 HW LRO

Backport the upstream v8 MT7988 HW-LRO work, with review fixes:
- preserve page_pool on normal/RSS rings;
- use the MT7988 LRO timer register at 0x6c00;
- keep IRQ group 0 deterministic and route rings 5..7 explicitly;
- use per-MAC deterministic DIP slots and safe rule replacement;
- preserve rules across LRO feature toggles;
- avoid the global MTU reduction and redundant napi_synchronize().

Signed-off-by: OTB V5 Build <root@localhost>
